Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.25,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] Alright, we're rolling. The street is quiet tonight, just the way we planned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:10.00,SpkB,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}B{\b0}] Quiet is good. Last time the corner was crawling with onlookers before we even started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:15.00,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] I brought the chalk. We can mark the lines before the crowd shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:19.75,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] Mark them wide. Nobody should be guessing where the boundary is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:23.75,SpkB,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}B{\b0}] And the water table? Somebody has to keep the bottles on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.00,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] I already filled the cooler. Ice, towels, and a spare roll of tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:33.25,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] Good. Now we just wait for the lights to come on over the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:37.25,SpkB,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}B{\b0}] When they do, we walk in steady. No rush, no noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:42.00,SpkC,,0,0,0,,[{\b1}C{\b0}] Steady wins. The ones who rush always trip on the first line.
